PATCH 465: FUN_0000_3425 -- the node-kind 0x1e VEHICLE facing pre-pass (windshield-object frontier, slice 2).

word[0x4b2c+0x1e] (the per-kind rasterizer table 286e dispatches) points at 0x3425, which Ghidra never made
a function (mid-block entry): classes 0-3 (every tank/vehicle, via c5fc -> c91c kind 0x1e) route here, so
the port's icall fell through to the overlay miss path (SEGV in m_mga_3fca once patches 462-464 let a
vehicle node reach 286e).  asm 0x3425-0x3533 (SS=DS=DGROUP; 8-local bp frame): skip own vehicle; 0541
(bearing + range camera->node), 077e over the halved Z delta (pitch), 5e2/5dd of the relative heading,
rotate the node's [+0x16]/[+0x18] pair into view space (imul/shl-1 high words), pick the facing sprite
frame from the per-code table word[0x268e+code] + clamp(|Lc-pitch+0x400|,0x4000)>>11 and add
byte[di+8] to the record code; tail-jump `jmp word[0x4b2c+kind-0x18]` = the kind-6 sprite rasterizer
2e49.  Uses the published 0541 cx/dx (patch 328) and the 0459/patch-309 sign convention for 5e2/5dd.
